---
description: Flutter unit, widget, and regression testing
globs: flutter_app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Business logic must be testable without Flutter widgets.

Write unit tests for important use cases, repositories, business rules,
validation, and data transformations.
Write widget tests for important user-facing behavior.

Before changing existing behavior, inspect existing tests, preserve valid
coverage, and update tests when behavior intentionally changes.
Do not remove or weaken tests simply to make implementation pass.

For bug fixes, identify the root cause, add or update a regression test when
practical, implement the smallest appropriate fix, and run relevant tests.
